      "name": "What are the best alternatives to JamBase?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "As of October 17, 2026, alternatives to JamBase in media-entertainment on the Manufact MCP catalog include Credits.fm, SceneF, HANKOOKILBO MCP, Ticketbox.vn, and drawnames."
      }
    },
